{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Minuteurs systemd du projet : mise à jour du staging et tâches ML (prévision, surveillance, entraînement), avec leurs variantes -production. Source : collecteur systemd de node-exporter.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Minuteurs",
      "description": "Actif : le minuteur planifie bien la tâche. Arrêté : systemctl enable --now <minuteur> sur la machine (alerte MinuteurArrete).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_systemd_unit_state{name=~\".+\\\\.timer\", state=\"active\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Actif",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "Arrêté",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dernier lancement des tâches",
      "description": "État du dernier lancement de chaque service (alerte TachePlanifieeEnEchec). Il reste en échec jusqu'au lancement réussi suivant. monitor-ml en échec : code 2 = dérive du modèle (ml.model_health).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_systemd_unit_state{name=~\".+\\\\.service\", state=\"failed\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Échec",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dernier déclenchement",
      "description": "Heure du dernier déclenchement de chaque minuteur. En retard (alerte MinuteurEnRetard) : mise à jour du staging > 10 min, prévision > 2 h, surveillance > 26 h, entraînement > 8 jours.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_systemd_timer_last_trigger_seconds * 1000 > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "dateTimeFromNow",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Historique des lancements",
      "description": "Échec : le service est resté en échec sur cette période (jusqu'au lancement réussi suivant).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_systemd_unit_state{name=~\".+\\\\.service\", state=\"failed\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Échec",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "alignValue": "left",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
